#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:2 c8415ce97b0949bfa5a1edc3e1d5a33c
msgid "_`CMakeLists Configuration`"
msgstr "CMakeLists 配置"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:5 d42af440094e4c50b04759e183abcfbb
msgid "_`Overview`"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:7 d5560550a69a40ca865451f627e83094
msgid "The CMakeLists.txt file is the core build configuration file for this project, responsible for project building, dependency management, and module compilation."
msgstr "CMakeLists.txt 文件是本项目的核心构建配置文件，负责项目构建、依赖管理与模块编译。"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:11 7b0dbfefc6c64885b560d7a5d13a27a7
msgid "_`Key Features`"
msgstr "主要特性"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:13 8bca01fe3d714a51af65abcf8d7d64d9
msgid "Project initialization and metadata parsing"
msgstr "项目初始化与元数据解析"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:14 a0daf6043eba489f9440b265140767a8
msgid "Automatic source file collection and target creation"
msgstr "自动源文件收集与目标创建"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:15 717231c78f7f460490183e5d88626961
msgid "Dependency management and linking"
msgstr "依赖管理与链接"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:16 d9bb6e91112549b8bcb1120a39bde82e
msgid "C++ module support configuration"
msgstr "C++ 模块支持配置"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:17 54c8a1793079473f8553b71b39c2cfae
msgid "Installation rule definition"
msgstr "安装规则定义"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:20 eff40eeb7dbe460bbc2944d90ebc17ef
msgid "_`Main Configurations`"
msgstr "主要配置项"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:22 efc68d8ea24d4a1d9b1e515734117804
msgid ""
"The CMake configuration automatically reads project information from "
"metadata.json, collects source files from include and src directories, "
"creates separate static libraries for C and C++ components, and "
"configures module support for C++23 and above."
msgstr ""
"CMake 配置会自动从 metadata.json 读取项目信息，从 include 和 src 目录收集源文件，为 C 和 C++ "
"组件分别创建静态库，并配置 C++23 及以上版本的模块支持。"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:26 b082c8b6450e48c0a29a549ef1f4517b
msgid ""
"Platform-specific module compilation is handled with appropriate settings"
" for MSVC (.ixx files) and GCC/Clang (.cppm files). The configuration "
"also includes installation rules for libraries and headers."
msgstr ""
"平台特定的模块编译通过针对 MSVC (.ixx 文件) 和 GCC/Clang (.cppm 文件) "
"的适当设置进行处理。该配置还包含库和头文件的安装规则。"
